flowchart LR
    accTitle: Cost, capacity, and spend control
    accDescr: A flowchart showing how cost estimation, capacity planning, spend monitoring, and brake mechanisms work together to control AI service costs.

    W[Workload estimate] --> CE[Cost estimation]
    CE --> |tokens × rate| B[Budget allocation]
    B --> CP[Capacity planning]
    CP --> |provision| EP[Endpoints deployed]
    EP --> M[Monitoring dashboard]
    M --> |over threshold| SB[Spend brake]
    M --> |under budget| R[Regular operations]
    SB --> |halt| EP
    SB --> |notify| H[Human operator]
    R --> |periodic| A[Audit and adjust]
    A --> CE
